{
  "about": "Origin recognition vectors (OpenSpec change task-origin, design D3). internal/origin/vectors_test.go runs FromURL(url, title) and web/src/lib/origin.test.ts runs originFromUrl(url, title) on every case; want null means the input gives no origin. The \"labels\" list (extension-v2) holds whole origin values: internal/origin/vectors_test.go checks Validate and Label, web/src/lib/origin.test.ts checks originLabel; a null label is checked for validity only. The \"obsidian\" list (obsidian-origin) holds whole origin values with an Obsidian note link: internal/origin/obsidian_test.go checks Validate, Label and ObsidianTip on each, and ParseObsidianURL against link (whether the url alone is a valid note link, the shells' check; null without a url); web/src/lib/taskOrigin.test.ts checks obsidianLink against link, obsidianURL against valid (obsidian origins with an id, a url and no provider), originLabel and obsidianPlace (the tooltip), and that only valid ones get a link.",
